OL,3,GNEWSADog seized after village attack
OL,4,Aconcerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog believed to be a banned breed has
OL,7,Fbeen seized by police following reports
OL,8,Fof attacks in a village.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said officers
OL,11,Fexecuted a warrant in Foxton on
OL,12,FWednesday and seized a dog believed to
OL,13,Fbe a Dogo Argentino, a breed prohibited
OL,14,Funder the Dangerous Dogs Act.
OL,16,FPolice said the dog had caused
OL,17,F"significant concern" within the
OL,18,Fvillage following reports it had
OL,19,Fattacked other dogs.
OL,21,FInquiries are ongoing and no arrests
OL,22,Fhave been made, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
